# Client engagement platform — Cursor Rules

Project-wide Cursor rules generated by EmbedIQ. Path-scoped rules in this same directory add language- and compliance-specific guidance automatically.

## Stack
- Languages: typescript
- Build: npm

## Ground rules
- Run tests before committing; never commit code that fails tests.
- Keep changes scoped to the task; avoid drive-by refactors.
- Prefer editing existing files over creating new ones.
- Never hardcode secrets, API keys, or credentials.
